{"id":185,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自学創造と探究で伸びる安田学園中高","feature_description":"安田学園中学校高等学校は、創立者の精神を受け継ぐ自学創造教育を軸に、グローバル教育、キャリアデザイン教育、学習支援を組み合わせて生徒の可能性を伸ばす学校です。クラブ活動も盛んで、学習と課外活動を両立しながら、自ら考え行動する力を育てます。家庭・生徒・教師が連携する三位一体の支援も特徴です。進路と学校生活をつなぐ支援で、将来像を具体化しやすい構成です。","clubs":[{"id":3250,"name":"男子バスケットボールクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3251,"name":"女子バスケットボールクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3252,"name":"男子バレーボールクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3253,"name":"女子バレーボールクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3254,"name":"男子バドミントンクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3255,"name":"女子バドミントンクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3256,"name":"サッカークラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3257,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3258,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3259,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3260,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3261,"name":"ゴルフクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3262,"name":"バスケットボールクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/news/14353/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3263,"name":"生物クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yasuda.ed.jp/news_cat/club/pa